[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Danish Gambit"]
[Variation "Danish Gambit Declined: Queen grabs d4"]
[ECO "C21"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "low"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "trap,pawn-grab"]
[Themes "remove-the-defender"]
[Refutes "1. e4 e5 2. d4 exd4 3. c3 d5 4. exd5 Qxd5 5. cxd4 Nc6 6. Nf3 Bb4+ 7. Nc3 Bg4 8. Be2 Bxf3 9. Bxf3 Qxd4"]
[For "white"]
[Kind "for-us"]
[Opponent "9...Qxd4"]
[Start "1. e4 e5 2. d4 exd4 3. c3 d5 4. exd5 Qxd5 5. cxd4 Nc6 6. Nf3 Bb4+ 7. Nc3 Bg4 8. Be2 Bxf3 9. Bxf3"]

9... Qxd4 $2 { Grabs a pawn, but the queen is defended only by the knight. } 10. Bxc6+ { Takes the knight with check. Black has to recapture, and that removes the only defender of the queen. } 10... bxc6 11. Qxd4 { Wins the queen, since nothing recaptures on d4. White is a queen up for a bishop and ahead overall. } *
